# Ordered part list for the z module.
#
# Format: <part-file>  [<section title used in the bundle>]
# The first entry is the head part: it carries the module banner and is
# emitted verbatim, so it takes no title. Every later part becomes a major
# section in the assembled file, in this order.

header.zsh
debug.zsh    DEBUGGING — TRACING, PROFILING, ASSERTIONS
cache.zsh    CACHE — PROCESS-SCOPED KEY/VALUE WITH OPTIONAL TTL
sys.zsh      SYSTEM — PLATFORM DETECTION, INTERRUPTS, FATAL EXITS
config.zsh   CONFIGURATION — BACKED BY THE zkv `config` STORE
help.zsh     HELP SYSTEM
event.zsh    EVENT BUS INTEGRATION — zbus
init.zsh     INITIALIZATION
